        Recommendation: Use <b>Texture2D.SetPixels32()</b>, <b>Texture2D.GetRawTextureData()</b>,
          or <b>Texture2D.Apply()</b> instead.
        DocumentationUrl: 
        MinimumVersion: 
        MaximumVersion: 
        Type: UnityEngine.Texture2D
        Method: SetPixels
