      - Id: PAS0010
        Title: 'Player (WebGL): Data Caching is disabled'
        MessageFormat: 
        DefaultSeverity: 4
        IsEnabledByDefault: 1
        Areas: 32
        Platforms: 14000000
        Description: The <b>Data Caching</b> option in Player Settings is disabled.
          Asset data will be re-downloaded every time the content is loaded in a
          browser. This can increase load times.
        Recommendation: Enable <b>Data Caching</b> to cache build files in the browser
          cache.
        DocumentationUrl: 
        MinimumVersion: 
        MaximumVersion: 
        Type: UnityEditor.PlayerSettings+WebGL
        Method: dataCaching
        Value: False
      - Id: PAS0011
        Title: 'Player (WebGL): Linker Target is deprecated'
        MessageFormat: 
        DefaultSeverity: 4
        IsEnabledByDefault: 1
        Areas: 68
        Platforms: 14000000
        Description: <b>WebGLLinkerTarget.Asm</b> linker target setting is deprecated.
        Recommendation: Set <b>UnityEditor.PlayerSettings.WebGL.linkerTarget</b>
          to <b>WebGLLinkerTarget.Wasm</b> to generate code in WebAssembly format.
        DocumentationUrl: 
        MinimumVersion: 2018.1
        MaximumVersion: 
        Type: UnityEditor.PlayerSettings+WebGL
        Method: linkerTarget
        Value: Asm
      - Id: PAS0009
        Title: 'Player: Engine Code Stripping is disabled'
        MessageFormat: 
        DefaultSeverity: 4
        IsEnabledByDefault: 1
        Areas: 1
        Platforms: 0d0000000900000014000000
        Description: The <b>Strip Engine Code</b> is option in Player Settings is
          disabled. The generated build will be larger than necessary.
        Recommendation: Enable <b>Strip Engine Code</b> in <b>Project Settings >
          Player > Other Settings > Optimization</b>.
        DocumentationUrl: 
        MinimumVersion: 
        MaximumVersion: 
        Type: 
        Method: 
        Value: 
